"# Maintainers\n"
"\n"
"This file lists the maintainers of the project. For information on how to contribute, please refer to the CONTRIBUTING.md file.\n"
"\n"
"## Current Maintainers\n"
"\n"
"| Name | GitHub ID | Affiliation | Responsibilities |\n"
"|------|-----------|-------------|------------------|\n"
"| Zhang San | zhangsan | Example Corp | Project Lead, Core Module |\n"
"| Li Si | lisi | Example Ltd | API Design, Code Review |\n"
"| Wang Wu | wangwu | Independent | Documentation, Community Management |\n"
"\n"
"## Emeritus Maintainers\n"
"\n"
"| Name | GitHub ID | Affiliation | Period |\n"
"|------|-----------|-------------|--------|\n"
"| Zhao Liu | zhaoliu | Example Inc | 2020-2023 |\n"
"\n"
"## Maintainer Responsibilities\n"
"\n"
"- Review and merge pull requests\n"
"- Triage and respond to issues\n"
"- Guide project direction and roadmap\n"
"- Ensure code quality and test coverage\n"
"- Maintain community health and conduct\n"
"\n"
"## Adding or Removing Maintainers\n"
"\n"
"New maintainers are added by a majority vote of existing maintainers. A maintainer may step down at any time by notifying the project lead.\n"

